@host = http://localhost:5080

### List supported regions
GET {{host}}/api/regions
Accept: application/json

### Simulate — Israel 10:00 local (approved)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "region": "IL", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T07:00:00Z" }

### Simulate — Israel 23:00 local (rejected)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "region": "IL", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T20:00:00Z" }

### Simulate — Japan 09:00 local (approved)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "region": "JP", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T00:00:00Z" }

### Approved transactions (cards)
GET {{host}}/api/transactions/approved?limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Sign up
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@shva.co.il", "password": "secret123" }

### Log in
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@shva.co.il", "password": "secret123" }
